rking management, and airport traffic management services. It also provides staffing and payroll management services, such as recruitment, payroll processing, temporary staffing, and executive search; production support for manufacturing, logistics, and material handling operations; surveillance, access control, security audits, event security, and traffic management services; hygienic and nutritious food services; waste management solutions, including effluent treatment, CETP development, bio-mining of legacy waste, and Zero Liquid Discharge technologies; level maintenance, HVAC and AHU maintenance, fire, smoke and carbon monoxide detection systems, automated firefighting systems, and electrical systems; event management and beverage services; and specialised cleaning, maintenance, and allied home services. The company serves healthcare, education, public administration, airports, railways, metro infrastructure, manufacturing, entertainment, commercial spaces, and retail industries. The company was incorporated in 2000 and is based in Mumbai, India. Krystal Integrated Services Limited operates as a subsidiary of Krystal Family Holdings Private Limited.","employees":42151,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1789084800,"asOf":1795210477},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795210477,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Krystal Integrated Services\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Krystal Integrated Services Limited (KRYSTAL.BO) Seasonal returns chart","s":"Yahoo Finance UK","d":1794995945,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE1nT0RPeERPclNYOTBkbW5JQ0Z4bjdZRU5RNDNHTzVsUGFyM0lTRjJIOU9leVhxbmZsbExDbm5VQ0ZBWkpKVy12SmZhcHRpcFVHdlZXWC01Z0N0ajVkbEZhVDlPZDhlMTBaNmc?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Krystal Integrated Investor Analysis | StockIQ","s":"The Economic Times","d":1794950314,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPOHIzZVVjSzY5MHBzWXhQY214ZERTMkotUi1IcjctM09HenlBNm11bi12LXZrdVY5cG